From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sunu Aziz Rahayu <sunuazizrahayu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] lineage: drop OPlus UDFPS extension for generic GSI

libudfps_extension.oplus (hardware/oplus/fingerprint) memakai
generated_kernel_header_defaults, satu-satunya penarik generator
kernel headers vendor/lineage yang gagal di GSI tanpa kernel
("No rule to make target 'headers_install'").

Ekstensi UDFPS khusus OPlus ini opsional untuk GSI generik;
surfaceflinger kembali ke default tanpa Extension.
---
 lineage.mk | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lineage.mk b/lineage.mk
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/lineage.mk
+++ b/lineage.mk
@@ -12,6 +12,3 @@ TARGET_BOOT_ANIMATION_RES := 1080

 # APN
 PRODUCT_PACKAGES += apns-conf.xml
-
-#Oplus fingerprint
-$(call soong_config_set,surfaceflinger,udfps_lib,//hardware/oplus:libudfps_extension.oplus)
--
2.54.0
